Which of the following gives the factorization of $z^4 + 4$ into quadratic polynomials with *real* coefficients?

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ (z^2 - 2z + 2)(z^2 + 2z + 2) $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ (z^2 - 4)(z^2 + 4) $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ (z^2 - 2)(z^2 + 2) $

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$ (z^2 - 2 sqrt(2) z + 2)(z^2 + 2 sqrt(2) z + 2) $

